Package: vpsm-client
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: VPSM Project <tiubo@localhost>
Depends: @SHLIB_DEPENDS@, sudo | doas, iproute2, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-window
Description: Authenticated VPSM IPv4 TUN client
 Qt 6 GUI and headless VPSM clients with an authenticated UDP data plane,
 replay protection, Linux TUN configuration and overlay IPv4 routing.
